	"209": {
		"cId": "209",
		"name": {
			"nominative": "Venerable and Godbearing Father Anthony the Great († 356)",
			"short": "St Anthony"
		},
		"scriptures": [
			{
				"service": "matins",
				"type": "1",
				"reading": "Mt_11:27-30",
				"pericope": "43",
				"cmd": "dow != 0"
			},
			{
				"service": "liturgy",
				"type": "apostol",
				"reading": "Heb_13:17-21",
				"pericope": "335"
			},
			{
				"service": "liturgy",
				"type": "gospel",
				"reading": "Lk_6:17-23a",
				"pericope": "24"
			}
		],
		"hymns": [
			{
				"kind": "troparion",
				"service": "liturgy",
				"type": "1",
				"tone": "4",
				"body": "<p>Emulating the demeanor of the zealous Elijah, and following the Baptist with forthright steps, O father Anthony, thou wast a dweller in the desert, and hast made the whole world steadfast by thy supplications. Wherefore, entreat Christ God, that our souls be saved.</p>"
			},
			{
				"kind": "kontakion",
				"service": "liturgy",
				"type": "1",
				"tone": "2",
				"body": "<p>Having cast off the tumults of life, thou didst live a life of stillness to the end, emulating the Baptist in every way, O all-venerable one. Wherefore, we honor thee with him, O Anthony, first among the fathers.</p>"
			}
		]
	},
