	"409": {
		"cId": "409",
		"name": {
			"nominative": "Saint Parthenius, Bishop of Lampsacus on the Hellespont (4<sup>th</sup> C)",
			"short": "Saint Parthenius"
		},
		"scriptures": [],
		"hymns": [
			{
				"kind": "troparion",
				"service": "liturgy",
				"type": "1",
				"tone": "4",
				"body": "<p>O God of our fathers, * deal with us ever according to Thy meekness. * Deprive us not of Thy mercy, * but through their supplications ** direct our life in peace.</p>"
			},
			{
				"kind": "kontakion",
				"service": "liturgy",
				"type": "1",
				"tone": "3",
				"body": "<p>Thou didst receive the divine grace of miracles, * O sacred Parthenius of godly wisdom, God-bearing wonder, * cleansing the faithful of all the passions and dispelling spirits of wickedness, O father. * Wherefore, we hymn thee as a great initiate ** of the mysteries of the grace of God.</p>"
			}
		]
	},
	"410": {
		"cId": "410",
		"name": {
			"nominative": "Venerable Luke of Hellas († c. 946)",
			"short": "Venerable Luke"
		},
		"scriptures": [],
		"hymns": []
	},
