	"543": {
		"cId": "543",
		"name": {
			"long": "St. Gregory Palamas, Archbishop of Thessalonica",
			"shortN": "Saint Gregory Palamas",
			"shortF": "for the Hierarch",
			"nominative": "Saint Gregory Palamas, Archbishop of Thessalonica († c.  1360)",
			"short": "Saint Gregory"
		},
		"church": {
			"rank": 1
		},
		"info": {
			"birthY": "1296",
			"birthN": "about",
			"placeB": "Asia Minor",
			"deathY": "1359",
			"deathM": "11",
			"deathD": "14",
			"placeD": "Mt. Athos"
		},
		"scriptures": [
			{
				"service": "liturgy",
				"type": "apostol",
				"reading": "Heb_7:26-8:2",
				"pericope": "318"
			},
			{
				"service": "liturgy",
				"type": "gospel",
				"reading": "Jn_10:9-16",
				"pericope": "36"
			},
			{
				"service": "unknown",
				"type": "apostol",
				"reading": "Heb_7:26-8:2",
				"pericope": "318",
				"cmd": "nday == -35"
			},
			{
				"service": "unknown",
				"type": "gospel",
				"reading": "Jn_10:9-16",
				"pericope": "36",
				"cmd": "nday == -35"
			}
		],
		"hymns": [
			{
				"kind": "troparion",
				"service": "unknown",
				"tone": "8",
				"body": "Light of Orthodoxy, pillar and doctor of the Church, adornment of monks, invincible champion of theologians, O Gregory the wonderworker, praise of Thessalonica, preacher of grace, ever pray that our souls may be saved."
			},
			{
				"kind": "kontakion",
				"service": "unknown",
				"tone": "8",
				"podoben": "2",
				"body": "Organ of wisdom, holy and divine, bright clarion of theology, we praise thee in harmony, O divine speaker Gregory: But as a mind standing before the First Mind, direct our mind to Him, father, that we may cry: Rejoice, preacher of grace!"
			},
			{
				"kind": "kontakion",
				"service": "unknown",
				"tone": "4",
				"body": "Now is the time for action, judgment is at our doors. So let us rise and fast, and let us offer tears of compunction with almsgiving, crying: We have sinned more than the sand of the sea. But forgive us all, O Creator, that we may receive incorruptible crowns."
			}
		]
	},
	"544": {
		"cId": "544",
		"name": {
			"nominative": "Hieromartyr Theodotus, Bishop of Cyrenia († c. 326)",
			"short": "Hieromartyr Theodotus"
		},
		"scriptures": [],
		"hymns": [
			{
				"kind": "troparion",
				"service": "liturgy",
				"type": "1",
				"tone": "1",
				"body": ""
			},
			{
				"kind": "kontakion",
				"service": "liturgy",
				"type": "1",
				"tone": "3",
				"body": "<p>Thou didst denounce the sea of false belief, * and with the faith of correct belief wound the falsehood of the godlessness of idolatry; * and as a divine immolation * thou bedewest the ends of the earth with thy wonderworking. ** O holy hierarch Theodotus our father, entreat Christ God to grant us great mercy!</p>"
			}
		]
	},
