	"1470": {
		"cId": "1470",
		"name": {
			"nominative": "Martyr Sozon of Cilicia († 304)",
			"short": "Martyr Sozon"
		},
		"scriptures": [
			{
				"service": "liturgy",
				"type": "apostol",
				"reading": "Eph_6:10-17",
				"pericope": "233"
			},
			{
				"service": "liturgy",
				"type": "gospel",
				"reading": "Jn_15:17-16:2",
				"pericope": "52"
			}
		],
		"hymns": [
			{
				"kind": "troparion",
				"service": "liturgy",
				"type": "1",
				"tone": "4",
				"body": "<p>In his suffering, O Lord, * Thy martyr Sozon received an imperishable crown from Thee our God; * for, possessed of Thy might, * he set at nought the tormentors and crushed the feeble audacity of the demons. ** By his supplications save Thou our souls.</p>"
			},
			{
				"kind": "kontakion",
				"service": "liturgy",
				"type": "1",
				"tone": "2",
				"body": "<p>Assembling today, with a loud voice let us praise Sozon, * the true and divinely wise martyr, * the skilled athlete of piety, * the initiate of the mysteries of grace, * the most generous bestower of healings: ** for he entreateth Christ God in behalf of us all.</p>"
			}
		]
	},
