				"body": "<p>Thou didst lighten the heaviness of the flesh by thy works * and didst give speedy wings to thy soul by enlightenment, O Michael; * and thou hast shown thyself to be a dwelling-place for the Trinity, ** beholding Whom, O blessed one, pray thou unceasingly for us all.</p>"
