	"1715": {
		"cId": "1715",
		"name": {
			"nominative": "Martyrs Probos, Tarachos and Andronicus, at Tarsus in Cilicia († 304)",
			"short": "Martyrs"
		},
		"scriptures": [
			{
				"service": "liturgy",
				"type": "apostol",
				"reading": "Eph_6:10-17",
				"pericope": "233"
			},
			{
				"service": "liturgy",
				"type": "gospel",
				"reading": "Lk_21:12-19",
				"pericope": "106"
			}
		],
		"hymns": [
			{
				"kind": "troparion",
				"service": "liturgy",
				"type": "1",
				"tone": "5",
				"body": "<p>The heavenly powers were amazed at the struggles of the Holy Martyrs, for even in their mortal bodies, they fell upon the bodiless enemy by the power of the Cross, invisibly defeating them. Therefore they are praying to the Lord that He may have mercy on our souls.</p>"
			},
			{
				"kind": "kontakion",
				"service": "liturgy",
				"type": "1",
				"tone": "2",
				"body": "<p>Soldiers and Martyrs of Christ, Probus, Tarachus, and Andronicus, Revealed to us the glory of the Trinity: For you cleansed all from the errors of atheism, Fighting valiantly for the faith, O honorable sufferers.</p>"
			}
		]
	},
	"1716": {
		"cId": "1716",
		"name": {
			"nominative": "Venerable Cosmas the Hymnographer, Bishop of Majuma († c. 787)",
			"short": "Venerable Cosmas"
		},
		"scriptures": [],
		"hymns": [
			{
				"kind": "troparion",
				"service": "liturgy",
				"type": "1",
				"tone": "0",
				"body": "<p>Instructor of Orthodoxy, teacher of piety and purity, light of the universe and God-inspired adornment of the hierarchs, O wise Cosmas, with thy teachings thou hast enlightened all. O spiritual flute, pray unto Christ God that our souls may be saved.</p>"
			},
			{
				"kind": "kontakion",
				"service": "liturgy",
				"type": "1",
				"tone": "0",
				"body": "<p>O God-inspired Cosmas, thou hast adorned thyself with virtues, adorning the church of Christ with hymns, O Blessed One. But pray to the Lord that He may deliver us from the snares of our enemies, as we cry out to thee: rejoice, O most richly adorned Father.</p>"
			}
		]
	},
