	"1843": {
		"cId": "1843",
		"name": {
			"nominative": "Venerable Procopius, Confessor of Decapolis († c.  750)"
		},
		"scriptures": [],
		"hymns": [
			{
				"kind": "troparion",
				"service": "liturgy",
				"type": "1",
				"tone": "0",
				"body": "<p>With the streams of thy tears thou didst irrigate the barren desert, * and with sighs from the depths of thy soul thou didst render thy labors fruitful an hundredfold. * Thou wast a beacon for the whole world, radiating miracles. ** O our father Procopius, entreat Christ God that our souls be saved.</p>"
			},
			{
				"kind": "kontakion",
				"service": "liturgy",
				"type": "1",
				"tone": "4",
				"body": "<p>The Church, possessing thee today as a morning star, dispelleth all the darkness of heresy, * honoring thee, O all-glorious Procopius, ** initiate of the heavenly mysteries.</p>"
			}
		]
	},
