	"4181": {
		"cId": "4181",
		"name": {
			"nominative": "Holy Great Martyr Procopius of Cæsarea in Palestine and those with him († 303)",
			"short": "Great Martyr"
		},
		"scriptures": [
			{
				"service": "liturgy",
				"type": "apostol",
				"reading": "II Tim_2:1-10",
				"pericope": "292"
			},
			{
				"service": "liturgy",
				"type": "gospel",
				"reading": "Mt_10:37-11:1",
				"pericope": "39"
			}
		],
		"hymns": [
			{
				"kind": "troparion",
				"service": "liturgy",
				"type": "1",
				"tone": "4",
				"body": "<p>In his suffering, O Lord, * Thy martyr Procopius received an imperishable crown from Thee our God; * for, possessed of Thy might, * he set at nought the tormentors and crushed the feeble audacity of the demons. ** By his supplications save Thou our souls.</p>"
			},
			{
				"kind": "kontakion",
				"service": "liturgy",
				"type": "1",
				"tone": "2",
				"body": "<p>Set afire by divine zeal for Christ, * and protected by the might of the Cross, O Procopius, * thou didst cast down the audacity and boldness of the fœ, * and didst raise up an honorable church, ** excelling in faith and enlightening us.</p>"
			}
		]
	},
