	"4207": {
		"cId": "4207",
		"name": {
			"nominative": "Holy 45 Martyrs at Nicopolis in Armenia († c. a 319): Leontius, Mauricius, Daniel, Anthony, Alexander, Meneus, Janicita, Sisinius, Biriladus, and others",
			"short": "Holy 45"
		},
		"scriptures": [],
		"hymns": [
			{
				"kind": "troparion",
				"service": "liturgy",
				"type": "1",
				"tone": "4",
				"body": "<p>In their sufferings, O Lord, * Thy martyrs received imperishable crowns from Thee our God; * for, possessed of Thy might, * they set at nought the tormentors and crushed the feeble audacity of the demons. ** By their supplications save Thou our souls.</p>"
			},
			{
				"kind": "kontakion",
				"service": "liturgy",
				"type": "1",
				"tone": "0",
				"body": "<p>For the sake of Christ, O martyrs, ye endured many torments. * Ye set at nought all of idolatrous polytheism and destroyed all the ungodliness of every falsehood, * trampling them down by the power of Christ. ** And ye teach us all to chant openly, with faith: Alleluia!</p>"
			}
		]
	},
