	"4243": {
		"cId": "4243",
		"name": {
			"nominative": "Hieromartyr Athenogoras, Bishop of Heracleopolis, and his 10 Disciples († c. 311)",
			"short": "Hieromartyr Athenogoras"
		},
		"scriptures": [],
		"hymns": [
			{
				"kind": "troparion",
				"service": "liturgy",
				"type": "1",
				"tone": "1",
				"body": ""
			},
			{
				"kind": "kontakion",
				"service": "liturgy",
				"type": "1",
				"tone": "4",
				"body": "<p>Following the love of the Master, * as an excellent pastor thou didst lay down thy life for the sheep of Christ, * O hieromartyr Athenogenes; * for this cause we praise thee, and with thee the ten disciples who suffered with thee, * instructed by the fear of God and thy teaching. * Wherefore, with His life-creating right hand the Master hath crowned you who pleased Him. ** Him do ye entreat in behalf of us all.</p>"
			}
		]
	},
