	"4505": {
		"cId": "4505",
		"name": {
			"nominative": "Hieromartyr Eutychius, disciple of the Apostle John the Theologian (1<sup>st</sup> C)",
			"short": "Hieromartyr Eutychius"
		},
		"scriptures": [],
		"hymns": [
			{
				"kind": "troparion",
				"service": "liturgy",
				"type": "1",
				"tone": "4",
				"body": "<p>As thou didst share in the ways of the apostles * and didst occupy their throne, * thou didst find thine activity to be a passage to divine vision, * O divinely inspired one. * Wherefore, ordering the word of truth, * thou didst suffer for the Faith even to the shedding of thy blood. ** O hieromartyr Eutychius, entreat Christ God, that our souls be saved.</p>"
			},
			{
				"kind": "kontakion",
				"service": "liturgy",
				"type": "1",
				"tone": "3",
				"body": "<p>As one who shared the throne of the apostles and the adornment of holy hierarchs, * O Eutyches, thou wast glorified in martyrdom, * didst shine forth like the sun, illumining all, * and didst dispel the profound night of ungodliness, ** Wherefore, we honor thee as a truly divine initiate of the mysteries of Christ.</p>"
			}
		]
	},
