	"43901": {
		"cId": "43901",
		"name": {
			"nominative": "Venerable Zoe and Photina (5<sup>th</sup> C)",
			"short": "Venerable Zoe"
		},
		"scriptures": [],
		"hymns": [
			{
				"kind": "troparion",
				"service": "liturgy",
				"type": "1",
				"tone": "0",
				"body": "<p>With the streams of thy tears thou didst quench the flames of temptations, O blessed one, * and taming the billows of the sea and the raging of wild beasts, thou didst cry out: ** Most glorious art Thou, O Almighty, Who savest me from fire and tempest!</p>"
			},
			{
				"kind": "kontakion",
				"service": "liturgy",
				"type": "1",
				"tone": "2",
				"body": "<p>As a skilled ascetic of piety, * an honored athlete by volition, * and an inhabitant and citizen of the desert, * we praise the ever-honorable Martinian in hymns, as is mee; ** for he trampled the serpent underfoot.</p>"
			}
		]
	},
