	"97802": {
		"cId": "97802",
		"name": {
			"nominative": "Saint John Chrysostom, Archbishop of Constantinople († 407)",
			"short": "Saint John"
		},
		"scriptures": [
			{
				"service": "matins",
				"type": "1",
				"reading": "Jn_10:1-9",
				"pericope": "35 (mid.)",
				"cmd": "dow != 0"
			},
			{
				"service": "liturgy",
				"type": "apostol",
				"reading": "Heb_7:26-8:2",
				"pericope": "318"
			},
			{
				"service": "liturgy",
				"type": "gospel",
				"reading": "Jn_10:9-16",
				"pericope": "36"
			}
		],
		"hymns": [
			{
				"kind": "troparion",
				"service": "liturgy",
				"type": "1",
				"tone": "0",
				"body": "<p>Grace shining forth from thy mouth like a beacon hath illumined the universe, * and disclosed to the world treasures of uncovetousness, and shown us the heights of humility; * but while instructing by thy words, O father John Chrysostom. ** intercede with the Word, Christ our God, to Save our souls.</p>"
			},
			{
				"kind": "kontakion",
				"service": "liturgy",
				"type": "1",
				"tone": "0",
				"body": "<p>From the heavens hast thou received divine grace, * and by thy lips thou dost teach all to worship the one God in Trinity, * O John Chrysostom, all-blessed righteous one. ** Rightly do we acclaim thee, for thou art a teacher revealing things divine.</p>"
			}
		]
	},
